notesEn:
* In the final version of the third game, all three copies of this card look identical in one's deck. However, within the game's files there are fully complete textures for each unique copy of the card. It is unknown why these other textures were removed.
**Despite this, some gwent players can be seen using these alternate versions, such as the unnamed halfling during the {{HoS}} quest, Dead Man's Party.

